deo></span><br><br>Imagine turning a rock into a powerful gunslinger to defend you from dangers. All opportunities and combinations open up with the power of ether.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/dca60b9eaf0209b48c29b5a43d1c91b5.poster.avif?t=1754066437\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/dca60b9eaf0209b48c29b5a43d1c91b5.webm?t=1754066437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/dca60b9eaf0209b48c29b5a43d1c91b5.mp4?t=1754066437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This pink ball isn't as innocent and cute as it seems; the game also delves into the complex human themes surrounding life, death, and existence.<br><br>Plan different strategies to overcome obstacles and advance in the world, facing mysterious characters and diving into the depths of Weefager's planet, discovering its hidden stories and secrets.<br><br>Meet some of the enemies and discover their abilities:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/60d8b9a38fb318fca74700e8d47a204c.poster.avif?t=1754066437\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/60d8b9a38fb318fca74700e8d47a204c.webm?t=1754066437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/60d8b9a38fb318fca74700e8d47a204c.mp4?t=1754066437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/c524578db3045922cf31d71f87732d89.poster.avif?t=1754066437\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/c524578db3045922cf31d71f87732d89.webm?t=1754066437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/c524578db3045922cf31d71f87732d89.mp4?t=1754066437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/5e7730df7e7c68229a350025bfbe238a.poster.avif?t=1754066437\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/5e7730df7e7c68229a350025bfbe238a.webm?t=1754066437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749640/extras/5e7730df7e7c68229a350025bfbe238a.mp4?t=1754066437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use the souls wisely and explore the planet with Weefager!",
